# ── secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit a real key. The deployer key must be a fresh wallet.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.nodekey
keystore/
UTC--*
**/secrets/
genesis-with-keys.json

# chain/build/ is written by `besu operator generate-blockchain-config` and
# contains the live validator / enode node key. Losing it stops the chain
# permanently; publishing it hands the chain to anyone. See chain/README.md.
chain/build/

# ── foundry ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
contracts/out/
contracts/cache/
# anvil-rehearsal build dirs (scripts/anvil_rehearsal.sh uses --out out-fork --cache-path cache-fork)
contracts/out-fork/
contracts/cache-fork/
contracts/broadcast/**/dry-run/
contracts/lib/

# ── node ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
.vercel/

# ── python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── generated artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Design and site screenshots: large, regenerable, and concept art rather
# than a record of the live site. Regenerate with the scripts next to them.
artifacts/**/*.png
artifacts/site-shots/out/

# ── scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log

# ── kept private (deliberate) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Working research notes: heavy verbatim quoting of private reference
# material and of the operator's unrelated projects. Not publishable as-is.
docs/research/
# Adversarial reviews written against specs whose findings are not yet
# resolved. Republish as a security appendix once each finding has a status.
artifacts/design-options/attack-*.md
artifacts/design-options/judge-attack.md
# X account operating playbook: house copy rules and reply strategy.
docs/04-X-PROMPTS.md
# Superseded documents. They still carry the geth Clique plan (overturned by
# decision #12) and the exit-queue economics (overturned by #13). Kept on disk
# for provenance, out of the repo so nobody quotes them as current.
docs/*.bak.md
docs/_old_*.md
artifacts/sim/*.bak.md
artifacts/sim/_spec_section.md
# Screenshot tooling: hardcoded local Playwright paths, not runnable elsewhere.
artifacts/**/shoot*.mjs
artifacts/**/shots.mjs

.claude/settings.local.json
# Session handoff notes: carry live server ops detail (login, key filename,
# sudo policy, co-tenant workloads). Local only.
HANDOFF.md
docs/05-BRAND-COPY.md

# ── operating material, local only ───────────────────────────────────────
# Launch runbooks, social copy, brand prompts and submission payloads. These
# tell anyone reading exactly what we plan to post and when; they are not code
# and they do not belong in a public repository.
docs/04-*.md
docs/05-*.md
docs/06-*.md
docs/07-*.md
docs/08-*.md
tools/launch-announce.mjs
deployments/launch/
# Reference images and prompts derived from another company's official mascot.
# The project states it is not affiliated with Binance; publishing a file that
# documents deriving the mark from Binance's own artwork argues the opposite.
artifacts/brand-assets/bibi-reference/
artifacts/brand-assets/**/production-notes.md
artifacts/brand-assets/agent-face-study/
scripts/x_length.py
